**Title:** A River's Whisper

**Description:** Join young Finn and his raven companion, Echo, as they embark on a serene journey along the whispering riverbanks, enveloped in the tranquil embrace of nature. In this gentle tale, Finn encounters a small turtle, discovering lessons of patience and connection in its untangling. As the river sings its lullaby, Finn sketches beneath the starlit sky, finding peace and reflection in every moment. Designed to soothe and calm, this poetic sleep story invites you to let go of daily anxieties and drift into a restful slumber, wrapped in the gentle rhythm of the river's endless journey.

**Keywords:** sleep story, tranquility, nature, bedtime, relaxation, river, night sky, peaceful, calming, mindfulness, Finn, Echo, reflection, gentle journey, sleep support

